<title>TUNISIA: SOCCER-ESPERANCE WIN TUNISIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ESPERANCE WIN TUNISIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esperance Sportive de Tunis beat Club Sportif Sfaxien 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in the final of the Tunisian Cup on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Sami Laroussi 70</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
</text>
